WEBVTT

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.625
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:20.542
<i>Between us half-demon twins, </i>
<i> two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.708 --> 00:00:23.292
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.417 --> 00:00:25.208
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:27.250
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.542 --> 00:00:29.083
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.333
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.500
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.375
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:39.208
<i>A Feudal Fairytale, </i>
<i> Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:43.417
<i>We'll keep moving forward </i>
<i> through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:46.292 --> 00:00:48.000
Her Highness enters!

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:55.333
You may raise your heads.

00:00:56.125 --> 00:00:57.750
MASTER OF HIRAIKOTSU –
HISUI

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:02.750
DEMON SLAYERS – NANASUKE, ROKUTA
It's not the Lord?

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:03.875
Who is she?

00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:05.958
PRINCESS AIYA
Were you surprised, demon slayers?

00:01:05.958 --> 00:01:09.500
It was not my father
who called you, it was me.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.917
I am Aiya, daughter of
Ogigayatsu Hiiragi Danjo.

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.375
Huh...

00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:17.875
So that's the Lord's daughter.

00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:18.833
I see.

00:01:19.042 --> 00:01:21.875
So, demon slayers.
Which one of you is the chief?

00:01:21.875 --> 00:01:24.917
Unfortunately, our chief is currently absent.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.250
Absent?

00:01:27.542 --> 00:01:31.333
I don't know if I should talk to you
if your chief is not here.

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:36.333
Please, I will heed your request
with full responsibility in our chief's absence.

00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:38.375
What kind of job do you have for us?

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.083
So you'll take his place, huh?

00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:46.458
Do you want to know that badly?
I see, you must be dying to hear it!

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.083
I didn't say anything.

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:50.708
That's understandable.

00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:53.125
If you accept our job,

00:01:53.125 --> 00:01:58.458
you might even join the Ogigayatsu
Hiiragi family's mercenary forces after all.

00:02:00.542 --> 00:02:02.667
Join His Excellency's forces?

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:04.000
That would be amazing.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.833
We'd be set for life!

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:10.917
Yes, just so. That makes you happy,
doesn't it? Be glad and rejoice.

00:02:10.917 --> 00:02:14.833
However, what I am offering you
is not a demon-slaying job.

00:02:16.708 --> 00:02:18.833
It's a contest!

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.125
A contest?

00:02:21.125 --> 00:02:24.208
If you emerge victorious in this
special contest of mine,

00:02:24.208 --> 00:02:26.458
then you can join our forces.

00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:30.750
And here are your opponents.

00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:33.375
Come on in, bounty hunters!

00:02:33.625 --> 00:02:35.375
THE LADY

00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:37.292
THE NINJA

00:02:37.542 --> 00:02:39.000
THE GRANNY

00:02:39.417 --> 00:02:40.958
THE MUSCLE

00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:48.000
I know, I understand. You demon slayers
may think that this is not enough.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:52.667
However, the fun doesn't end here.
Be surprised. I wager you are so surprised!

00:02:53.917 --> 00:02:55.417
That princess...

00:02:55.417 --> 00:02:57.792
She sure is having fun by herself.

00:02:57.792 --> 00:02:58.792
Yeah.

00:02:59.042 --> 00:03:02.792
Now, bring me the other bounty hunter.

00:03:02.958 --> 00:03:04.667
Let go of me!

00:03:04.667 --> 00:03:06.917
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA
You're kidding me, right? Hey!

00:03:06.917 --> 00:03:07.917
Moroha?

00:03:09.583 --> 00:03:13.417
Demon slayers, I hear that
you have a strange girl in your ranks.

00:03:13.417 --> 00:03:15.667
Through the Corpse Dealer
Jyubei's recommendation,

00:03:15.667 --> 00:03:18.917
I'm having this one join
the ranks of the bounty hunters.

00:03:18.917 --> 00:03:21.125
How about it?
They're more than enough, right?

00:03:21.125 --> 00:03:23.750
So you'll accept? Of course you will!
I know you want to!

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:26.375
I'll be expecting a spectacle!

00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:11.542
"Princess Aiya's Beniyasha Hunting"

00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:19.000
We can join the Lord's forces if we win.
Man, can you imagine?

00:05:19.292 --> 00:05:25.042
Yeah, but Hisui, is it really okay to
do this without Chief's go-ahead?

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.917
Uncle has always been taking care of us.

00:05:27.917 --> 00:05:30.542
It's time for us to repay
some of that kindness.

00:05:30.917 --> 00:05:33.542
And I already have a plan.

00:05:34.833 --> 00:05:36.583
Hey, Moroha.

00:05:36.583 --> 00:05:38.167
RACCOON DOG DEMON – TAKECHIYO
Are you done?

00:05:38.167 --> 00:05:39.292
RACCOON DOG DEMON – TAKECHIYO
Ugh, geez.

00:05:39.667 --> 00:05:44.917
Why does someone like me have to fight
the demon slayers with those bounty hunters?

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:49.583
On top of that, I have to attend some
long, boring strategy meeting.

00:05:49.583 --> 00:05:51.583
You shouldn't be complaining.

00:05:51.583 --> 00:05:54.917
There's still a lot of debt
that your master left over.

00:05:55.667 --> 00:05:59.458
Master Jyubei will be getting
the money for your participation.

00:06:00.458 --> 00:06:01.667
Geez.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.500
Oh, right.

00:06:03.917 --> 00:06:07.292
The demon slayers
gave me this to give to you.

00:06:07.458 --> 00:06:08.292
Here.

00:06:09.833 --> 00:06:11.000
What's this?

00:06:12.667 --> 00:06:14.333
Defeat Moroha?

00:06:14.583 --> 00:06:18.833
Yeah. The job from the princess
is a battle with the bounty hunters,

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:21.625
but they'll be no match for us.

00:06:21.625 --> 00:06:24.208
The only one we'll have to
take down is Moroha.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.333
So, will you accept?

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:28.208
DEMON SLAYER – SETSUNA

00:06:28.208 --> 00:06:29.208
DEMON SLAYER – SETSUNA
One thing.

00:06:29.208 --> 00:06:31.208
We need to keep this a secret from Towa.

00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:43.417
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASHI

00:06:44.375 --> 00:06:45.375
Huh?

00:06:49.542 --> 00:06:53.000
Good morning, Moroha.
Where's Setsuna?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.250
S-Setsuna?

00:06:54.333 --> 00:06:56.583
Wh-Who knows?

00:06:58.042 --> 00:07:01.417
Okay. So are you going somewhere?

00:07:01.417 --> 00:07:02.375
Something like that.

00:07:02.875 --> 00:07:04.583
So early in the morning?

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:09.417
You know, it's nothing much,
just a large scale battle, so...

00:07:09.417 --> 00:07:10.500
I'm off!

00:07:10.792 --> 00:07:12.667
Okay, be safe.

00:07:15.417 --> 00:07:18.833
Did Moroha just say something
about a "battle"?

00:07:20.167 --> 00:07:21.458
A battle?

00:07:24.917 --> 00:07:27.667
Hey, Moroha, wait.

00:07:29.042 --> 00:07:31.208
I have to let Setsuna know!

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:35.542
I almost let it slip to Towa.

00:07:35.542 --> 00:07:39.458
Why do I always have to come with you
on these things?

00:07:39.875 --> 00:07:44.458
I told you, didn't I? If we succeed,
I'll get you those candies from Towa.

00:07:44.458 --> 00:07:46.792
Those Rock-Paper-Scissor
chocolates you love.

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:50.125
Will this really work, though?

00:07:50.125 --> 00:07:52.917
It'll be fine. The plan is perfect.

00:07:52.917 --> 00:07:55.750
I don't like it,
but I guess I have no choice.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.208
There won't be a second time, okay?

00:08:01.042 --> 00:08:02.708
Setsuna, are you here?

00:08:03.292 --> 00:08:04.875
Huh? No one's here.

00:08:06.708 --> 00:08:08.375
CAT DEMON – KIRARA
Oh, Kirara.

00:08:08.375 --> 00:08:10.750
Do you know where Setsuna
might have gone?

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:11.917
Moroha's in trouble.

00:08:14.125 --> 00:08:17.917
Heave-ho. Heave-ho.

00:08:19.667 --> 00:08:23.417
Today will be so much fun!
Come on, pick up the pace!

00:08:30.125 --> 00:08:33.250
So, where are the bounty hunters?

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:34.792
It's already time.

00:08:39.542 --> 00:08:42.375
Come on, start the show already!

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.500
Was there a castle here?

00:08:58.500 --> 00:08:59.917
Did they build it overnight?

00:09:03.292 --> 00:09:06.417
If it's for a bounty,
I'll even build a castle!

00:09:06.625 --> 00:09:08.417
I am the bounty hunter lady!

00:09:09.208 --> 00:09:13.667
If it's for a bounty, I can sneak anywhere!
I am the bounty hunter ninja!

00:09:13.875 --> 00:09:16.792
I foresee that we will win this battle.

00:09:16.792 --> 00:09:21.000
All right, so that's that!
I am the bounty hunter granny!

00:09:21.667 --> 00:09:26.500
Brawn over brains!
I am the bounty hunters' muscle!

00:09:27.958 --> 00:09:30.083
– Come on, you too!
– Seriously?

00:09:30.083 --> 00:09:32.083
We went over this yesterday!

00:09:32.083 --> 00:09:33.292
R-Right.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:38.750
I am Moroha.
Moroha the Demon Killer!

00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:43.542
We are the strongest bounty hunters!
We will always get...

00:09:43.792 --> 00:09:45.625
...the bounty!

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.125
Wait, me too?

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.958
Pose!

00:09:49.542 --> 00:09:50.792
What's happening?

00:09:50.792 --> 00:09:53.542
So, should we follow their lead, or...

00:09:54.042 --> 00:09:56.125
No, let's just get this over with.

00:09:56.125 --> 00:09:57.042
Yeah.

00:09:58.667 --> 00:10:00.083
Fire!

00:10:00.667 --> 00:10:02.833
Something's flying toward us.

00:10:02.833 --> 00:10:04.792
Everyone, attack!

00:10:05.583 --> 00:10:08.375
Attack? But those are oil pots.

00:10:08.375 --> 00:10:11.292
Hmph, I'll just use my muscles!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:16.542
Whoa, hey, muscles won't solve this.
Shouldn't we just run?

00:10:16.708 --> 00:10:17.917
What?

00:10:23.708 --> 00:10:26.125
Huh? Just with one oil pot...

00:10:26.125 --> 00:10:28.083
The castle's already burning.

00:10:29.458 --> 00:10:33.042
The princess wishes to
see a spectacle. Keep on firing!

00:10:33.375 --> 00:10:34.333
Yes, sir!

00:10:40.625 --> 00:10:41.583
Whoa!

00:10:45.042 --> 00:10:48.250
Wow, this is amazing!
As expected from the demon slayers!

00:10:48.625 --> 00:10:51.208
Go! More fire!

00:10:56.792 --> 00:11:00.417
What the heck is going on with them?!
I didn't hear about this!

00:11:07.917 --> 00:11:10.875
Over there! Kirara, can you get closer?

00:11:20.375 --> 00:11:23.958
It's going to fall! Everyone, run for it!

00:11:27.625 --> 00:11:30.167
Aren't they going too far with this?

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:36.750
Damn, I <i>really </i>didn't hear about this!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.250
Moroha!

00:11:41.583 --> 00:11:43.250
Moroha, I'm here to help you.

00:11:43.833 --> 00:11:45.875
Towa? Why are you...

00:11:46.208 --> 00:11:47.125
Grab on!

00:11:54.958 --> 00:11:57.792
Towa and Kirara? Did you tell her?

00:11:57.875 --> 00:12:00.167
I didn't. Did you?

00:12:00.167 --> 00:12:01.792
No, of course not.

00:12:02.208 --> 00:12:04.292
I'm the one who told her not to tell.

00:12:06.833 --> 00:12:09.292
Either way,
we're in a bit of a bind now.

00:12:09.792 --> 00:12:13.375
We're all on this ship now.
We must see it through to the end.

00:12:13.708 --> 00:12:16.000
Leave handling Towa to me.

00:12:21.333 --> 00:12:22.417
Moroha.

00:12:22.417 --> 00:12:23.958
Why are you in a battle?

00:12:23.958 --> 00:12:28.875
Well, you see, it was something I had no choice
but to participate in, so…

00:12:29.208 --> 00:12:31.542
But you're fighting all by yourself!

00:12:31.917 --> 00:12:34.792
Oh, I had some people on my side, but...

00:12:35.292 --> 00:12:39.583
Was this a job from Mr. Jyubei?
Because of that debt?

00:12:39.583 --> 00:12:42.042
Uh, well, yes.

00:12:42.708 --> 00:12:44.625
This isn't a laughing matter.

00:12:44.625 --> 00:12:48.542
I wanted to also let Setsuna know,
but I couldn't find the demon slayers.

00:12:49.292 --> 00:12:51.083
I think you'll find them soon.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.542
Are you looking for me?

00:12:54.833 --> 00:12:56.125
Setsuna?

00:12:57.042 --> 00:13:00.458
Don't get in our way, Towa.
We're in the middle of a battle.

00:13:00.958 --> 00:13:02.917
Why are you here, too?

00:13:03.042 --> 00:13:07.167
Right now I'm simply doing my job
as a member of the demon slayers.

00:13:07.167 --> 00:13:11.083
That's right. Setsuna and I are currently
in the middle of an epic battle.

00:13:11.542 --> 00:13:15.583
Does that mean the ones you're fighting
are the demon slayers?

00:13:16.167 --> 00:13:18.000
Hey, what are we gonna do?

00:13:18.083 --> 00:13:20.583
It wasn't in the plan for Towa to join.

00:13:21.125 --> 00:13:23.542
If we stop here, then it'll be pointless.

00:13:23.542 --> 00:13:28.333
Setsuna should be taking care of Towa,
so let's just keep going.

00:13:45.208 --> 00:13:48.917
This is horrible.
I'll go talk to the demon slayers.

00:13:48.917 --> 00:13:50.167
Hey, Towa! Stop it.

00:13:50.625 --> 00:13:51.833
Don't meddle in our business.

00:13:53.875 --> 00:13:58.333
But all of this is just wrong!
Why do you and Moroha have to fight?

00:13:58.417 --> 00:13:59.917
We're on the same team!

00:14:01.167 --> 00:14:03.000
And who decided such a thing?

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:06.917
Towa, you are too soft after all.

00:14:07.458 --> 00:14:10.417
You don't understand anything,
and you don't see anything.

00:14:13.458 --> 00:14:17.917
Towa, if you get in my way,
I will have to defeat you, too!

00:14:26.208 --> 00:14:27.583
Hey.

00:14:27.583 --> 00:14:30.875
What are those girls
standing around chattering on about?

00:14:30.875 --> 00:14:33.042
What happened to all that fervor?

00:14:33.375 --> 00:14:34.958
Fight already!

00:14:35.417 --> 00:14:37.167
Fight more recklessly!

00:14:37.167 --> 00:14:40.917
Princess, please calm down.
You might fall off.

00:14:46.083 --> 00:14:49.542
Come on, Setsuna. Let's stop this already.

00:14:49.542 --> 00:14:53.125
I agree, Setsuna.
I don't think we have to go this far...

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.417
Shut up. Scourge of Swallows!

00:14:59.208 --> 00:15:00.958
Oh, no. Move, Towa!

00:15:02.375 --> 00:15:04.500
Instead of a battle...

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.458
It's become a sibling fight.

00:15:06.917 --> 00:15:11.167
Never mind that, let's just take care
of Moroha. You're here, right?

00:15:11.458 --> 00:15:12.458
Yep!

00:15:13.125 --> 00:15:14.583
Towa, are you okay?

00:15:14.583 --> 00:15:15.458
Yeah.

00:15:15.583 --> 00:15:18.250
Hey, Setsuna, you're going too far.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:20.125
We must finish this one way or another.

00:15:20.583 --> 00:15:21.667
Are you serious?

00:15:26.125 --> 00:15:28.125
You're unbelievable.

00:15:28.958 --> 00:15:33.208
Okay, I'm going to win this battle
and get that bounty.

00:15:33.792 --> 00:15:37.208
I'm the one who'll win.
I accepted the job, so I'll see it through!

00:15:38.917 --> 00:15:40.167
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:15:40.417 --> 00:15:41.875
Cyclone Burst!

00:15:42.333 --> 00:15:44.292
Please, both of you, stop!

00:15:47.417 --> 00:15:51.417
Wow, so is this what a battle
between girls looks like?

00:15:51.417 --> 00:15:53.708
This is fantastic!
I want to see more!

00:16:02.667 --> 00:16:04.708
Come on, please stop!

00:16:07.792 --> 00:16:11.292
Okay then, I won't let you two fight.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:30.417
No way!

00:16:30.792 --> 00:16:34.000
Why is it following me?!

00:16:36.125 --> 00:16:37.125
Moroha!

00:16:39.292 --> 00:16:41.083
Was it a misfire?

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.417
Looks like it.

00:16:43.792 --> 00:16:45.042
Moroha.

00:16:47.958 --> 00:16:51.167
Ouch, I'll get you for this!

00:16:51.167 --> 00:16:53.250
– That was close.
– No, it wasn't.

00:16:54.958 --> 00:16:58.583
Towa, sorry,
but we need to defeat Moroha.

00:16:58.583 --> 00:16:59.917
Hisui.

00:16:59.917 --> 00:17:00.792
Stop it!

00:17:01.167 --> 00:17:05.625
As a demon slayer, it's our duty to
see a job through to the end.

00:17:06.875 --> 00:17:10.083
That's how it goes, Towa.
Please, just stay back.

00:17:10.458 --> 00:17:12.208
I can't do that.

00:17:12.208 --> 00:17:16.167
If you're going after Moroha,
then I'll protect her with all I've got.

00:17:16.708 --> 00:17:20.458
Fine. Then we'll have to go all out, too.

00:17:21.292 --> 00:17:23.375
Wait, are you guys serious?

00:17:25.458 --> 00:17:26.542
Hiraikotsu!

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:39.208
Moroha!

00:17:41.958 --> 00:17:46.750
What a spectacular show.
I am duly satisfied. Take that, I say!

00:17:49.375 --> 00:17:53.625
Then, Princess,
will you really be employing them?

00:17:55.917 --> 00:18:00.833
Of course not. Father would never
consent to such a thing.

00:18:00.833 --> 00:18:03.125
It was obviously a lie I made up.

00:18:03.125 --> 00:18:04.375
That's what I thought.

00:18:05.333 --> 00:18:07.625
Y-You! Who are you!

00:18:08.333 --> 00:18:10.750
LEADER OF DEMON SLAYERS – KOHAKU
I am the Chief of the demon slayers.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:12.625
My name is Kohaku.

00:18:14.083 --> 00:18:15.250
Moroha.

00:18:19.417 --> 00:18:20.875
Moroha!

00:18:23.333 --> 00:18:25.500
Okay, that's the end of that.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.208
Now we can join the Lord's forces.

00:18:28.208 --> 00:18:29.375
We did it.

00:18:29.833 --> 00:18:31.083
But...

00:18:32.083 --> 00:18:35.292
This is terrible.
Is money that precious to you?

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:38.333
There's nothing more important than a life!

00:18:38.333 --> 00:18:39.292
Hey, Towa.

00:18:40.375 --> 00:18:41.917
I'm right here.

00:18:44.167 --> 00:18:49.792
Moroha? W-Why?
Then who am I holding...

00:18:50.042 --> 00:18:51.250
It's me.

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:00.208
Takechiyo.

00:19:00.208 --> 00:19:01.583
Let's switch.

00:19:04.875 --> 00:19:07.250
I can disguise my scent with this, too.

00:19:08.292 --> 00:19:09.250
Towa.

00:19:09.667 --> 00:19:12.750
The thing is, today's battle
had a bit more to it.

00:19:13.625 --> 00:19:14.708
More?

00:19:16.917 --> 00:19:19.917
So you're saying this was a fixed match?

00:19:20.125 --> 00:19:21.708
That's right.

00:19:22.417 --> 00:19:24.375
All of it was scripted.

00:19:24.625 --> 00:19:27.708
Winning this battle and
joining the Lord's forces

00:19:27.708 --> 00:19:30.458
means we demon slayers
won't have to worry about money.

00:19:30.458 --> 00:19:32.458
That's not going to happen.

00:19:36.875 --> 00:19:37.750
Chief?

00:19:38.417 --> 00:19:42.000
That employment offer
was a lie fabricated by that princess.

00:19:43.708 --> 00:19:45.625
No way.

00:19:47.083 --> 00:19:52.000
But I thought if we joined the Lord's forces,
then we could give you a better life.

00:19:52.333 --> 00:19:58.375
Listen, Hisui. Demon slayers
are there help those who are in need.

00:19:58.542 --> 00:20:02.542
It should never be for someone who's
taking care of us, or for the sake of money.

00:20:03.042 --> 00:20:06.167
I want you to carve that
deeply on your heart.

00:20:06.333 --> 00:20:08.583
I'm sorry, Uncle.

00:20:09.042 --> 00:20:10.542
Sorry.

00:20:16.458 --> 00:20:17.625
Unbelievable.

00:20:17.958 --> 00:20:22.625
Offering employment without my consent,
setting up a battle, even...

00:20:22.625 --> 00:20:23.958
OGIGAYATSU HIIRAGI DANJO
This is outrageous.

00:20:25.417 --> 00:20:28.292
But Father, I couldn't stand it!

00:20:29.417 --> 00:20:30.875
Intruder!

00:20:30.875 --> 00:20:31.917
Get them!

00:20:35.458 --> 00:20:37.167
Do not let them through.

00:20:37.167 --> 00:20:39.292
You're in the presence of His Excellency!

00:20:39.625 --> 00:20:40.958
Shut up!

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:52.625
Those girls dirtied my kimono,
and I just got so upset.

00:20:52.958 --> 00:20:57.083
Still, there are things you can
and cannot do, Aiya.

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:00.125
Forgive me!

00:21:02.958 --> 00:21:05.000
I'll never do it again!

00:21:16.625 --> 00:21:19.458
Hey, come on, don't be so upset.

00:21:19.458 --> 00:21:23.167
We couldn't tell you
because you're a terrible liar.

00:21:26.167 --> 00:21:28.917
Towa wouldn't understand,
it's just how business works.

00:21:46.208 --> 00:21:49.250
I'm so glad. I'm just so glad.

00:21:50.042 --> 00:21:51.667
Moroha's okay.

00:21:52.333 --> 00:21:54.667
And Setsuna is the usual Setsuna.

00:21:55.208 --> 00:21:58.417
I'm just so relieved.

00:22:00.292 --> 00:22:03.500
I feel like it would've been better
if you were just mad at us.

00:22:03.792 --> 00:22:05.833
I feel a bit guilty now.

00:22:06.333 --> 00:22:07.458
Yeah...

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:44.417
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:44.417 --> 00:23:48.167
When Setsuna was younger, she lived in
a hidden village beyond the valley.

00:23:48.167 --> 00:23:50.708
You seem to be tied to a strange destiny.

00:23:51.042 --> 00:23:54.458
Shiori is a half-demon
with the ability to create barriers.

00:23:54.458 --> 00:23:56.833
With her barrier, she protected the village.

00:23:56.833 --> 00:24:00.250
But demons who were after
the half-demon children showed up.

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:02.833
Suffer in my poison fog!

00:24:03.042 --> 00:24:06.250
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"The Hidden Village for Half Demons"

00:24:06.417 --> 00:24:23.936
If demons come here,
then it's to eat or kill us half-demons.
